[36m(TaskRunner pid=30464)[0m # State-Local Workflow
[36m(TaskRunner pid=30464)[0m In `CANDIDATE_SEARCH`, use only `find_product`. Create searches from the user request and avoid exact previous, failed, or same-turn duplicate searches.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=30464)[0m In `CANDIDATE_SELECT`, choose product ids from `candidate_pool`, then call `view_product_information` and `budget_check` in the same JSON array. The selected ids are the intended final bundle, not alternatives; use the exact same ids in both calls. For same-shop vouchers, group candidates by `shop_id` first.
